<title>UK: Dated Brent trades at firmer Sept Brent -20 cts.</title>
<headline>Dated Brent trades at firmer Sept Brent -20 cts.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>North Sea benchmark Dated Brent traded at a firmer Sept Brent less 20 cents on Wednesday, traders said.</p>
<p>The cargo, due to load Sept 9-11, was sold by the trading arm of a European major to a Swiss-based trader.</p>
<p>A Sept 8-10 Brent traded on Tuesday at Sept Brent less 25 cents.</p>
<p>Wednesday's seller was also seen offering a Sept 5-7 cargo at a similar price, traders said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7930</p>
